<title>AUSTRIA: Bank Austria ups CA bid - agency.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria ups CA bid - agency.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Austria, the leading bidder for the Austrian state's controlling stake in Creditanstalt has improved its offer for the bank, but gave no details, Austrian news agency APA said on Friday.</p>
<p>Nobody at the bank was immediately available to confirm the report. The bank originally offered 16.8 billion schillings ($1.5 billion) for the state's 19.9 million ordinary voting shares in the flagship bank.</p>
</text>
